GKD-XA native Miuix privilege UI

This module contains a source-level Android UI fork of Priv Kit v0.20.0
(original author: lisonge; https://github.com/priv-kit/priv-kit).
The official Maven release metadata declares the Apache License, Version 2.0.
See LICENSE and the original publication metadata in UPSTREAM.pom.

GKD-XA local changes replace the presentation layer with native Miuix components
and Android resource adapters. The authorization backend is not replaced.
Modified upstream files are identified in MODIFIED_FILES.txt and carry a
modification notice; original source hashes are retained in UPSTREAM.sha256.
Full provenance, integration instructions and verification limits: README.md.

Miuix 0.9.4 is an external dependency under its own Apache-2.0 notices.
